# QFusion 3master+3node 集群节点配置示例
# 请根据实际情况修改以下配置

# ============================================
# Master节点（3台）
# ============================================
# 格式: IP 主机名 角色 用户 认证信息
# 示例1: 使用密码
192.168.1.10 qfusion-master-1 master root password123
192.168.1.11 qfusion-master-2 master root password456
192.168.1.12 qfusion-master-3 master root password789

# 示例2: 使用SSH密钥
# 192.168.1.10 qfusion-master-1 master root /root/.ssh/id_rsa
# 192.168.1.11 qfusion-master-2 master root /root/.ssh/id_rsa
# 192.168.1.12 qfusion-master-3 master root /root/.ssh/id_rsa

# ============================================
# Worker节点（3台）
# ============================================
# 格式: IP 主机名 角色 用户 认证信息
192.168.1.13 qfusion-worker-1 worker root password123
192.168.1.14 qfusion-worker-2 worker root password456
192.168.1.15 qfusion-worker-3 worker root password789

# 示例2: 使用SSH密钥
# 192.168.1.13 qfusion-worker-1 worker root /root/.ssh/id_rsa
# 192.168.1.14 qfusion-worker-2 worker root /root/.ssh/id_rsa
# 192.168.1.15 qfusion-worker-3 worker root /root/.ssh/id_rsa

# ============================================
# 注意事项
# ============================================
# 1. IP地址: 请替换为实际的IP地址
# 2. 主机名: 请替换为实际的主机名
# 3. 用户名: 通常是root，也可以是其他有sudo权限的用户
# 4. 认证信息:
#    - 密码: 直接填写密码（明文，注意安全）
#    - 密钥: 填写私钥文件路径，如 /root/.ssh/id_rsa
# 5. 角色只能是: master 或 worker
# 6. 以 # 开头的行为注释，会被忽略
